  "bodyHash": "Du63vUCGqCQ=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓我睡覺</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 讓你能完全掌控 Minecraft 的睡眠體驗。🌙 從就寢限制到醒來後精神飽滿，幾乎睡眠的各個環節都可以自訂，以更符合你的世界和遊玩風格。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">找不到讓你無法入睡的怪物嗎？床在應該能用的時候卻失效了？想讓睡眠恢復生命、清除效果，或只是讓過程更順暢嗎？這個模組讓夜晚更靈活、挫折更少，而且擁有更高的自訂性。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌙 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更智慧的睡眠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可以在雨中睡覺、瞬間醒來，並享受流暢的入睡動畫。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👁️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">顯示附近的怪物：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">阻擋睡眠的怪物會短暫發光並發出環境音效，讓它們更容易被找到。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">😌 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">寬鬆的怪物檢查：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選擇忽略附近持續存在的、無法到達的或被動型怪物，以利於睡眠。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛏️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">靈活的床規則：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">移除距離、障礙物或怪物檢查，讓床的限制更少。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❤️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">恢復性睡眠：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">設定睡眠來恢復生命值，或是在醒來時調整飢餓值。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☀️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">天氣控制：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可選擇在醒來時重設天氣循環，迎接更平靜的早晨。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">醒來效果：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:wake_up_effects</span></code> 狀態效果<a href=\"https://docs.neoforged.net/docs/resources/server/datamaps/\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料映射</span></a>和 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:cleared_when_waking_up</span></code> 狀態效果標籤，在醒來時清除或套用效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧩 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料驅動相容性：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過標籤控制特殊行為，例如 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:never_prevents_player_rest</span></code> 和 <code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">letmesleep:no_sleeping_interruption</span></code>，以實現無縫的模組支援。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端可選安裝，伺服器端必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 和 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 版本）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 版本）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可以直接在遊戲內透過模組選單進行設定（在 Fabric 上需要安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有設定檔都位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 目錄，檔名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於設定檔類型。並非所有模組都會有所有類型，甚至可能完全沒有設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vikestep\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">VikeStep</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其已過時的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nearby-mob-finder\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Nearby Mob Finder</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，啟發了發光功能。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/spiky-spikes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/spikyspikes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/all-the-heads\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
